WEBVTT

29:31.667 --> 29:33.417
Before things calmed down,

29:33.834 --> 29:34.792
something ugly was said.

29:34.875 --> 29:36.667
-Don't get on my nerves.
-Listen to me, brother.

29:37.334 --> 29:39.209
Should we back down because
of a random floozy who's no more?

29:39.459 --> 29:41.959
-To hell with you guys!
-Somebody might hear you.
